  "details": "I dont have any problems like this when I first start playing vrchat, then after a while it doesn't play after the first video. I tried getting a fresh installation of windows 10 (21h1). It worked fine for the first few hours but then the problem is back.\nThese are the things i tried:\n- manually updated youtube-dl.exe\n- deleting all expired Google certificates (There weren't any in the first place).\n- made sure that untrusted URLs are allowed.\nI want to get this fixed since i feel left out from karaoke sessions.\nWindowsVideoMedia error 0xc00d36b4\nhere's my latest output log:\nhttps://pastebin.com/ijCmukHa",
